1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,038
At sunrise, we entered an old garden beside the wilderness.

2
00:00:03,988 --> 00:00:07,659
Debris covered the path, and a crack left a gap in the wall.

3
00:00:07,659 --> 00:00:10,647
This could be a splendid place,’ Mira said.

4
00:00:10,647 --> 00:00:14,045
A grand tree stood above a magnificent stone arch.

5
00:00:14,045 --> 00:00:18,329
Our teacher called the project a super idea and an interesting challenge.

6
00:00:18,329 --> 00:00:20,499
The change would be dramatic.

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,124
Nearby, a desert was spreading.

8
00:00:23,124 --> 00:00:27,681
If people continued to deforest the hills, more land could become barren.

9
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:32,443
We wanted fertile soil, so we would fertilise carefully and plant new trees.

